{"id":"4fd186fb6c30d412","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-name-rank.md","title":"ZFC Name Rank","display":"df-zfc-name-rank — ZFC Name Rank","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-name-rank","aliases":["58-df-zfc-name-rank"],"display":"df-zfc-name-rank — ZFC Name Rank","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-rank-on-wellfounded-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-name-rank"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-name-rank</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-name-rank — ZFC Name Rank"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1273aebf17781a00\" href=\"?note=1273aebf17781a00\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-rank-on-wellfounded-relation.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-rank-on-wellfounded-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,\\sigma,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P,\\sigma,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span> (forcing poset, candidate name, and rank candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NameRank}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{NameRank}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> (the least set of subnames containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{D,P}\">\\(R_{D,P}\\)</span> (the immediate-subname relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> (the ordinal-valued rank function on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{D,P}\">\\(R_{D,P}\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4RankOnWellfoundedRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4RankOnWellfoundedRelation}_S\\)</span> (well-founded relation rank graph, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1273aebf17781a00\" href=\"?note=1273aebf17781a00\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-rank-on-wellfounded-relation.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-rank-on-wellfounded-relation.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}name\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NameRank}_S(\\sigma,P,\\leq_P,\\alpha)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists D,R_{D,P},\\rho\\;\\Biggl[\n\\sigma\\in D\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\forall z\\in x\\;\n\\exists\\tau\\in D\\;\\exists p\\in P\\;\nz=\\langle\\tau,p\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\sigma\\in E\\land\n\\forall x\\in E\\;\\forall z\\in x\\;\n\\exists\\tau\\in E\\;\\exists p\\in P\\;\nz=\\langle\\tau,p\\rangle\n\\ \\to\\ D\\subseteq E\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land R_{D,P}\n=\\{\\langle\\tau,x\\rangle\\in D\\times D:\n\\exists p\\in P\\;(\\langle\\tau,p\\rangle\\in x)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4RankOnWellfoundedRelation}_S(D,R_{D,P},\\rho)\n\\land\\alpha=\\rho(\\sigma)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}name\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NameRank}_S(\\sigma,P,\\leq_P,\\alpha)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists D,R_{D,P},\\rho\\;\\Biggl[\n\\sigma\\in D\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\forall z\\in x\\;\n\\exists\\tau\\in D\\;\\exists p\\in P\\;\nz=\\langle\\tau,p\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\sigma\\in E\\land\n\\forall x\\in E\\;\\forall z\\in x\\;\n\\exists\\tau\\in E\\;\\exists p\\in P\\;\nz=\\langle\\tau,p\\rangle\n\\ \\to\\ D\\subseteq E\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land R_{D,P}\n=\\{\\langle\\tau,x\\rangle\\in D\\times D:\n\\exists p\\in P\\;(\\langle\\tau,p\\rangle\\in x)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4RankOnWellfoundedRelation}_S(D,R_{D,P},\\rho)\n\\land\\alpha=\\rho(\\sigma)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The closure clauses simultaneously certify that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> is a hereditary <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-name and construct exactly its subnames.</li>\n<li>Foundation makes the immediate-subname relation well founded; the imported rank graph then supplies the unique recursive ordinal assignment.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-rank-on-wellfounded-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"1273aebf17781a00","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-rank-on-wellfounded-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$, $\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]] and [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$, $\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]] and [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-rank-on-wellfounded-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"1273aebf17781a00","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4RankOnWellfoundedRelation}_S$ (well-founded relation rank graph, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-rank-on-wellfounded-relation.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq_P,\\sigma,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NameRank}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"R_{D,P}","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"R_{D,P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4RankOnWellfoundedRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}name\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NameRank}_S(\\sigma,P,\\leq_P,\\alpha)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists D,R_{D,P},\\rho\\;\\Biggl[\n\\sigma\\in D\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;\\forall z\\in x\\;\n\\exists\\tau\\in D\\;\\exists p\\in P\\;\nz=\\langle\\tau,p\\rangle\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\sigma\\in E\\land\n\\forall x\\in E\\;\\forall z\\in x\\;\n\\exists\\tau\\in E\\;\\exists p\\in P\\;\nz=\\langle\\tau,p\\rangle\n\\ \\to\\ D\\subseteq E\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land R_{D,P}\n=\\{\\langle\\tau,x\\rangle\\in D\\times D:\n\\exists p\\in P\\;(\\langle\\tau,p\\rangle\\in x)\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4RankOnWellfoundedRelation}_S(D,R_{D,P},\\rho)\n\\land\\alpha=\\rho(\\sigma)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":2053,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2833","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-name-rank.md|58-df-zfc-name-rank]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018","5582a281f